<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ was glorified, dying on the cross;</l><l>Glory was released—this was not a loss!</l><l>Spirit He became, for life-giving;</l><l>Last Adam is He, for His dispensing.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Resurrected, Christ thus was born to be</l><l>God’s firstborn Son with humanity.</l><l>Many sons were through resurrection, born;</l><l>The Lord Spirit, Christ, their being will transform.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We in faith were regenerated;</l><l>God and man thus incorporated.</l><l>This took place through Christ’s resurrection.</l><l>For His divine, glorious multiplication.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Three aspects of incorporation:</l><l>Father’s house for His satisfaction,</l><l>The true vine for His multiplication,</l><l>Child of the Spirit, for His move on earth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
